<p><ul>
<h4>Direct access to online <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/" target="_blank">help</a>: <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/msa/GMLMM.htm" target="_blank"><font size="+2">GMLMM</font></a></h4>
<h4>Access the application from the menu: <br>
<i>"File | Import | Vectors and/or databases | GML (Geography Markup Language) -> MMM"</i><br>
<i>"File | Export | PNT,ARC/NOD,POL -> GML (Geography Markup Language)"</i></h4>
</ul></p>
